Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,(南太平洋上的某处 1944年)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.27,0:03:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,《金刚：骷髅岛》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.95,0:03:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,(27号指令 布拉沃城堡测试和毁损)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就想走
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.69,0:12:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,把钱留下 不然要你好看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.49,0:12:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你小子给我听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.59,0:12:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是我的地盘 你识相点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.22,0:09:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,(越南 岘港空军基地)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.81,0:11:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,(泰国曼谷)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,(14号码头)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.06,0:15:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.35,0:18:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,(禁区 闲人勿进)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.54,0:18:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,(美国陆军 600颗弹药)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.81,0:18:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,(大地卫星)
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.28,1:04:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,(里格利球场 芝加哥小熊队的家)
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.07,1:20:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,宁死不屈
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.78,1:57:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,(最高机密 帝王计划)
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.82,1:57:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,(第8区 更多威胁)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.94,0:03:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们能利用让我们致胜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we can put this tremendous machine of ours,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.86,0:03:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,强大美国军力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which has made this victory possible,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.66,0:03:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,来追求和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to work for peace,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.50,0:03:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就能展望人类史上最伟大的时代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can look forward to the greatest age in the history of mankind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,卫星计划的进展速度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speed of progress in the satellite project{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.22,0:03:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不能作为弹道飞弹成果的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cannot be taken as an index of our progress{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.47,0:03:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,进展指标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in ballistic missile work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.35,0:03:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的下一个阶段是扩展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel we're on the brink of an area of expansion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.98,0:03:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,关于人类本身和周遭环境的知识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of knowledge about ourselves and our surroundings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.48,0:03:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那在目前仍不可名状或理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that is beyond description or comprehension at this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.32,0:04:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,人类史上第一次 把摄影机放到太空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the first time, we're putting cameras into space{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,俯视地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and looking down on the Earth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.66,0:04:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们发现前所未见的秘境和奇事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}allowing us to discover places and things we've never seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,未来也界最聪明的居民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The most intelligent inhabitants of that future world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不是人类或猴子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}won't be men or monkeys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.50,0:04:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,而是机器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll be machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.26,0:04:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这片未知的海域上启航\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We set sail on this new sea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.76,0:04:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,因为有新的知识等着发掘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because there is new knowledge to be gained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.43,0:04:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,无论这片新海域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whether this new ocean{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.56,0:04:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,会是和平之海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will be a sea of peace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.52,0:04:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,或是可怕的新战场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or a new terrifying theater of war...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,"征服人的野性"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"To tame the savageness of man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.07,0:04:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,"使这个也界的生活变得宜人"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"and make gentle the life of this world."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.57,0:04:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们致力于此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us dedicate ourselves to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.25,0:05:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,停战 停战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop the war! Stop the war!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.75,0:05:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 停战 - 全市的抗议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop the war! - As citywide protests{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.63,0:05:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,使国会委员会的听证会陷入停顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have brought congressional committee hearings to a standstill,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.59,0:05:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,想见未来几日的交通会更瘫痪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}promising more gridlock in the days and weeks ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.56,0:05:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,环线正经历严重堵车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Beltway is experiencing significant delays.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.31,0:05:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,记住我的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark my words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.93,0:05:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,华府不会有更糟的时刻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There'll never be a more screwed up time in Washington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们不能因此却步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we can't let it stop us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.44,0:05:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,真是够了 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on already, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.57,0:05:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,别档路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.07,0:05:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,也许现在不是开口的好时机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe now's not the best time to ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.74,0:05:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁克斯 帝王计划即将关门大吉 我们破产了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monarch is on the cusp of being shut down, Brooks. We're broke!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.41,0:05:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,当这场战争结束 我们的考察就永远无法获准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When this war ends, we'll never get approval for our expedition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.17,0:05:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我对我们的简报没信心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not confident in our presentation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的所有资料都是散页\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of our materials are loose leaf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.67,0:05:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,再一天 一天就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In one day, one day,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.76,0:05:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我能全部整理装订好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could have had all of this organized and bound...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.76,0:05:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,今天 我们达成协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we, today, have concluded an agreement{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.43,0:05:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,结束战争 为越南带来光荣的和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to end the war, and bring peace with honor in Vietnam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.27,0:05:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,所有美国军力都会撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All American forces will be withdrawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.94,0:05:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们连一天都没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.15,0:06:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔·朗达来见威尔斯参议员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bill Randa here to see Senator Willis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.59,0:06:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,果然是您 朗达先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, Mr. Randa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.03,0:06:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我今早留了讯息给您 说了今天要改期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I left you a message this morning about rescheduling today's appointment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.35,0:06:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但他接下来几周应该有空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he should have something available in the coming weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.95,0:06:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,艾尔 你气色真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Al, you're looking well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,朗达 你没收到我的讯息？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you didn't get the message, Randa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.54,0:06:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 改期？- 第5次？我一定没注意到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To reschedule? - For the fifth time? I must've missed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.21,0:06:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会速战速决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.62,0:06:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,别坐得太舒服 你们只有5分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, don't get comfortable. You got five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.53,0:06:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我开会要迟到了 那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm late for a meeting. So,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.03,0:06:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这次你要猎捕什么想像的怪兽？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what imaginary monster are you hunting this time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.14,0:06:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这是卫星照片拍到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a satellite photo{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.31,0:06:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,南太平洋上一座未知的岛屿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of an uncharted island in the South Pacific.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.64,0:06:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,至今仍是隐密的处女地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has defied discovery until now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.73,0:06:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,许多文明的传说中有提到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many civilizations spoke of it in legends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.48,0:06:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,骷髅岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skull Island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.36,0:06:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝未造完的国度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The land where God did not finish creation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.49,0:06:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,它恶名昭彰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's notorious{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.36,0:06:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,许多船和飞机在那里失踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the number of ships and planes that have gone missing there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.66,0:06:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,像是百慕达三角洲？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the Bermuda Triangle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.25,0:07:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,或像我周末喜欢或的防护帽？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or like that aluminum foil hat that I like to wear on the weekends?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.00,0:07:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,比起帽子倒是更像三角洲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's more like the triangle than the hat,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们认为没那么单纯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we like to think it's much more than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.06,0:07:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,1954年的喝彩城堡核弹测试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The 1954 Castle Bravo nuclear tests{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.69,0:07:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,并不是试验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}weren't tests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.18,0:07:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们想杀掉某个束西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were trying to kill something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.26,0:07:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信那里的生态系统 超乎我们的想像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe there's an ecosystem out there the likes of which we can't imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.18,0:07:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,而找到它的地方就是这座岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the place to find it is this island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那里是神秘和科学的交界处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A place where myth and science meet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.86,0:07:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,朗达 那只是童话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Randa, it's a fairy tale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.07,0:07:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,杜鲁门在1946年资助帝王计划时 可不这么认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry Truman didn't think so when he funded Monarch in 1946.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.91,0:07:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,就光说浪费吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In terms of sheer waste,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.70,0:07:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,帝王计划因搜寻外星生物名列前茅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monarch ranks right up there with the search for alien life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.75,0:07:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,对 但那些人是疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but those guys are nuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.46,0:07:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,早在几年前就该把你们关闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should have shut you down years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这是国家的大好机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is an opportunity for our country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.55,0:07:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 参议员 大地卫星派人去那座岛出任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Senator, Landsat is sending a mission to the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.05,0:07:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能顺势搭上他们的行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could piggyback on that operation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.47,0:07:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,当然一定要您的同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With your permission, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.39,0:07:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你们希望发现什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're you hoping you'll find?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.76,0:08:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,资源 药材 癌症的解药 地质发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Resources, medicine, the cure for cancer, geological discoveries. I mean...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.60,0:08:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,可能的替代燃料 参议员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Possible alternate fuels. Senator, look just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.48,0:08:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 老实说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, to be honest,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.07,0:08:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不确定那里有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we don't know for sure what's there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.73,0:08:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但我告诉你我们知道什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? But I will tell you what we do know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.24,0:08:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,明晚 俄国的诺佛卫星会经过这一区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow night, the Russian Novosat passes over this sector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.16,0:08:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,3天内他们会获得跟我们相同的影像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in three days, they're gonna have the same images we have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不管那里有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So whatever's there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,您会想要我们先找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you want us to find it first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.67,0:08:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.25,0:08:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我不敢相信我会这样说 但\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe I'm saying this, but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.10,0:08:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎言之有理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that almost made sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.13,0:08:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.68,0:08:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让你们搭上顺风车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I will get the piggyback for you. I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.30,0:08:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但听好了 听说我 就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But listen to me, listen to me. This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.76,0:08:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,到此为止 就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gotta end. This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.47,0:08:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你保证下不为例 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You promise me? Last favor? Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.10,0:08:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,参议员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Senator?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.98,0:08:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One last thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.44,0:08:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要军方保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to need a military escort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.61,0:09:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,注意 所有士兵和基地人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention, all soldiers and base personnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.05,0:09:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,最后的军队撤退将于6点开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Final troop withdrawal will commence at 0600.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.47,0:09:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,打包好行李 娘儿们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pack your bags, ladies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.52,0:09:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 米尔斯 - 什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Mills. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.69,0:09:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,结果你写给她几封信？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many letters did you end up writing her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.40,0:09:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,10到15封吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten, fifteen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.57,0:09:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,她写给你几封？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many did she write you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.73,0:09:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,3或4封吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, three, four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.53,0:09:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄 你老妈真差劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, you got a shitty mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,科尔 一定要这样说吗 谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Cole, for clearing that up. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,2天后我见到她时一定会转告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be sure to tell her when I see her in the next 48 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.49,0:09:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 你可能有个差劲老妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you might have a shitty mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.93,0:09:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.51,0:09:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,美国对共产党明示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The United States is making it clear to the Communists{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.55,0:10:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,美国战俘一获释 美军就会撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that American troop withdrawal is directly on the release of U.S. prisoners of war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.93,0:10:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,华府今天已通知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Washington notified the Viet Cong{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.68,0:10:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,越共和北越关于彻退…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and North Vietnamese today that the withdrawal...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.19,0:10:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.73,0:10:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,查普曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chapman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.69,0:10:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 需要效劳吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need anything, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.69,0:10:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我好得很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.28,0:10:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.70,0:10:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,查普曼 你回国后打算做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what're you gonna do when you get back to the world, Chapman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.29,0:10:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经在东方航空谋得职位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm already set up with Eastern Air Lines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.79,0:10:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,格雷斯和比利都搬到亚特兰大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grace and Billy all moved in in Atlanta,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.29,0:10:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,正在等我回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just waiting on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.96,0:10:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 您呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about you, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.96,0:10:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这一切是为了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All this for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.59,0:10:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,长官？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,查普曼 走吧 去找点乐子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here, Chapman. Go have some fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.06,0:10:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ls everything okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.31,0:10:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tip-top{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.12,0:11:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,派克中校 电话找您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel Packard! There's a phone call for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.08,0:11:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我是派克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Packard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.29,0:11:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,派克 我是沃德将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Packard, it's General Ward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.92,0:11:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你和弟兄们想出最后一趟任务吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and your boys up for one last op?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.25,0:11:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 我倒不反对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would not be opposed to that, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.17,0:11:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的返家指令已经通过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your orders to head home are already processed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.51,0:11:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,确定不想休息一下？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure you don't wanna take some time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.26,0:11:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我会执行任何下达的指令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here to execute whatever orders I'm given, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.80,0:11:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,别兴奋过头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, don't get too excited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.26,0:11:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一群大地卫星的科学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bunch of scientists called Landsat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.26,0:11:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在卫星上发现一座新岛屿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}discovered a new island on their satellite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.31,0:11:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他们需要直升机运输 协助调查工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They need helicopter transport for a survey job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,了解 长官？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that. And, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.94,0:11:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.44,0:11:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.78,0:11:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,朗达 我不懂 你已经争取到军方保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Randa, I don't get it. You already got us a military escort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.45,0:11:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,为何需要空降特勤队做向导？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do we need a tracker? And why SAS?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.29,0:11:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,前空降特勤队 不效忠任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Former SAS. No allegiance to anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.00,0:11:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,1972年他在岘港救了12名坠机飞行员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he rescued 12 downed pilots in Dé Nang, in '72.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.21,0:11:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但你的来源说他清醒时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But your source says that he spends most of his waking hours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.72,0:12:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,都在三流酒吧混\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in some back alley watering hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.47,0:12:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁克斯 你的耶鲁学历 能带领我们穿越丛林吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is your Yale degree supposed to lead us through the jungle, Brooks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.55,0:12:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,何况我爸说 别从喝酒的地方评判一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, my father told me never to judge a man by where he drinks,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,而是从酒品评判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only how he holds it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.31,0:12:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你认同我吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You on board with me here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.40,0:12:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.57,0:12:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.36,0:12:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要向他透露多少？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, uh, how much do we tell him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.99,0:12:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,只要让他答应就够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just enough to get him to say yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.03,0:13:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙值得好好聊聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now there's a man worth talking to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.36,0:13:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,未知的岛屿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An uncharted island?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.57,0:13:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,让我列出你的各种死法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me list all the ways you're gonna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.91,0:13:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,暴雨 高温 烂泥 苍蝇和纹子传染的疾病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rain, heat, mud, disease carrying flies and mosquitos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.75,0:13:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 你能带着疟疾的治疗药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, you could load up on the atabrine for the malaria,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但其他细菌呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but what about the other bacteria?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们甚至还没聊到想生吞你的玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We haven't even started on the things that want to eat you alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.09,0:13:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们加到两倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll double that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.26,0:13:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不懂这有多危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea how dangerous this is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.22,0:13:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我要五倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want five times that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.64,0:13:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,加上如果回得来的分红\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plus, a bonus if we make it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,如果？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,付他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pay him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.44,0:13:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,康拉德先生应该获得合理报酬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think Mr. Conrad should be fairly compensated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.77,0:13:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,敬和平时期捞一票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's to profit during peacetime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.90,0:13:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,有个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.90,0:13:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你们来找追踪手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came here looking for a tracker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.74,0:13:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我要追踪谁或什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who or what am I tracking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.66,0:13:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的资讯仅只于此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is all the information that we have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.25,0:13:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗 没有地图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? There is no map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.66,0:13:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,只有卫星影像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only satellite images.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.50,0:13:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们需要你这种高手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we need someone like you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.08,0:14:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,凭着你在未知丛林的 独特专业技术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with your skill, your unique expertise in uncharted jungle terrain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.92,0:14:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,领导我们展开地面探险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to lead us on our ground expedition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.09,0:14:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是学者和科学家 我们需要有经验的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're just scholars and scientists. We need someone with experience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.34,0:14:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,以免出了状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In case things go sideways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.35,0:14:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,人们参战是为了追寻某种真理 康拉德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men go to war in search of something, Mr. Conrad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.81,0:14:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you'd found it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.94,0:14:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在早就回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'd be home by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.04,0:14:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 韦弗 - 我是杰里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Weaver. - Yeah, it's Jerry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.63,0:14:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 杰里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Jerry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.88,0:14:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我 我中了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, tell me, did I get it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.34,0:14:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,大地卫星之旅？你中了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That Landsat thing? You got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.33,0:14:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.51,0:14:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.68,0:14:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是雅典娜号 停靠在曼谷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the Athena, docked in Bangkok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.47,0:14:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,14号码头 明晚6点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pier 14, 6:00 tomorrow night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.47,0:14:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,明晚6点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1800 tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:14:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 我欠你个人情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. I really owe you one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.64,0:15:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我不懂 为什么要参加这种测绘地图的活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't get it. Why do you want a gig documenting a mapping mission{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你一个能上时代封面的人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you're up for the cover of Time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,杰里 既然你三个线人的消息一模一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jerry, when three sources tell you the same thing word for word,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.40,0:15:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你就知道他们在说谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know they're lying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.82,0:15:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,事有蹊跷 某个不能说的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something going on here, something that nobody is talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.72,0:15:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们居然要出任务 没搞错？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe we're doing this. Are you guys kidding me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.06,0:15:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,再一天就回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A day away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.02,0:15:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一天就回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.85,0:15:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,何况还是去另一座岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no, now we gotta go to another island{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.69,0:15:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有另一座丛林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with another jungle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.40,0:15:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,越南不是岛 笨蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vietnam's not an island, dumb-ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.90,0:15:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,西礁岛就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Key West is,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.53,0:15:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那才是我们该待的地方 手上拿着酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that's exactly where I need to be right now, with a drink in my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.91,0:15:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,西礁也不是岛 是礁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Key West ain't an island either, it's a key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.54,0:16:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你很无趣 科尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't funny, Cole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.93,0:16:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我是梅森韦弗 摄影师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mason Weaver, photographer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.22,0:16:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,梅森·韦弗是女的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mason Weaver is a woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.76,0:16:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我没搞错的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last time I checked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.31,0:16:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,在境内2年 你属于哪个机构？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two years in country. Where you been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.24,0:16:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,安插在美国情报单位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Embedded with MACV-SOG.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.15,0:16:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你还真有种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, you were in the shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.07,0:16:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,向你致敬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I respect that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.74,0:16:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但就是你这种人 害我们失去国民支持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's people like you lost us support back home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.45,0:16:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会当真责怪没枪的人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not actually gonna blame the people without guns{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,打输战争吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for losing the war, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.58,0:16:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,相机比枪杆还危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Camera's way more dangerous than a gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.17,0:16:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我们没有打输战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we didn't lose the war,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.00,0:16:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是打腻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we abandoned it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.92,0:16:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.39,0:17:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,各位好 欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello and welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.27,0:17:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我是大地卫星的实地监督 维克多·涅韦斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Landsat Field Supervisor, Victor Nieves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.17,0:17:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我同事史蒂夫·伍德沃德 我们的资料管理员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my colleague Steve Woodward, our data wrangler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.24,0:17:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们探险的目的地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our expedition takes us to a place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.67,0:17:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是几世纪以来 人类所知每条航海贸易路径的禁地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}every nautical trade route known to man has avoided for centuries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.61,0:17:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,如我们的卫星显示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As our satellites show,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.78,0:17:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这座岛受到长期风暴系统包围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the island is surrounded by a perpetual storm system,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.12,0:17:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,让外界一直无法接触\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}allowing it to remain hidden from the outside world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.66,0:17:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,但可搭乘派克中校的直升机运输\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But with Colonel Packard's helicopter transport,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.58,0:17:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会是深入这处秘境的首例\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we will be the first to break through to the other side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.92,0:17:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也很高兴见到首度加入的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're also pleased to be joined, for the first time,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.64,0:17:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,资源探勘团队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the resource exploration team,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.30,0:17:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,向朗达先生领军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}led by Mr. Randa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.68,0:17:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,同行的还有生物学家孙小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and accompanied by biologist, Miss San,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.26,0:17:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,以及地质学家布鲁克斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and geologist, Mr. Brooks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.51,0:17:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的重心会是这座岛的表面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our focus will be on the island's surface,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.64,0:17:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的重心则是地底的物质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}theirs, what lies beneath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.19,0:17:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁克斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Brooks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.35,0:17:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,其实很简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simple, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会用炸弹撼动地表 制造震动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll use explosives to shake the earth and create vibrations,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.61,0:17:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,帮助我们勘测岛地表下的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}helping us to map the subsurface of the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.49,0:17:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在南岸上方 策略性地投下震源药包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll fly in over the south shore and then strategically drop seismic charges{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.66,0:17:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,进一步了解陆地密度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to better help us understand the density of the earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要投弹？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're dropping bombs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.96,0:18:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是科学仪器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scientific instruments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.37,0:18:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,弟兄们 听到没？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear that, boys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.66,0:18:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们变成科学家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're scientists now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.88,0:18:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你们才不是科学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys are not scientists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.70,0:18:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,接着我们登陆建立基地营\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll then land and make base camp{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.67,0:18:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,再由康拉德先生带领在地面游走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for ground excursions led by Mr. Conrad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.47,0:18:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克查普曼少校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Major Jack Chapman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.05,0:18:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好 一旦登上那座岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Once on the island,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.25,0:18:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,风暴的干扰 会切断我们与外界的所有通讯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the storm's interference will block all radio contact with the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.90,0:18:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那表示我们只能靠自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means we'll be by ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.18,0:18:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,3天后 燃料补给队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three days later, the refuel team{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.35,0:18:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,会在这座岛的北边跟我们会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will meet us here on the north end of the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.06,0:18:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我们唯一安全的离开时机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That may be our only safe departure window for an unknown period of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.65,0:18:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,所以给各位建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, tip for everybody,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.65,0:18:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,千万别错过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}don't miss it, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.38,0:18:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing down here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.26,0:19:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我才应该问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could ask you the same thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.43,0:19:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么地质勘测任务需要炸弹？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why does a geological mapping mission need explosives?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.10,0:19:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你没专心听课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You weren't listening in class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.23,0:19:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是地质调查用的震源药包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seismic charges for the geological survey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.69,0:19:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是喔 你相信那一套？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-huh. You believe that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.56,0:19:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我可没说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.15,0:19:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你见过派克中校了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you met Colonel Packard yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.11,0:19:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,见过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.28,0:19:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙受创很深\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guy's wound pretty tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.03,0:19:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他是战功彪炳的英雄 难免那副模样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the man's a decorated war hero. That's the package they come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.03,0:19:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那你呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.33,0:19:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,对摄影记者来说 绘制地图不会太简单吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't shooting a mapping mission a step down for a photojournalist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,适当的照片有能左右舆论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The right photo can help shape opinions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.75,0:19:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,并能赢得普利兹奖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And win you a Pulitzer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.42,0:19:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好 康拉德上尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Captain Conrad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.79,0:19:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那你呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.96,0:19:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,英国特种部队怎么会卷入这场行动？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did British special forces get dragged into this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.46,0:19:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,叫康拉德就好 我退役了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just "Conrad." I'm decommissioned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.14,0:19:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他们花钱请我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They offered me money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.51,0:19:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你不像佣兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't strike me as a mercenary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.18,0:19:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你不像战地摄影师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't strike me as a war photographer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.60,0:19:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,反战摄影师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anti-war photographer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,查普曼 你在写什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you writing there, Chap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.96,0:20:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,写信给我儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Letter to my boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.83,0:20:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,"亲爱的比利"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Dear Billy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.94,0:20:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,"我说会在你生日前回家"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I know I said I'd be home by your birthday,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.55,0:20:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,"但我当着你的面说谎"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"but I lied straight to your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.34,0:20:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,"我是个糟糕老爸"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I'm a terrible dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.80,0:20:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"希望这封信会补偿你"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I hope this letter makes up for it."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.68,0:20:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,太短了啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's too short.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.17,0:20:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这个风暴亲眼看到更险恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This storm looks a lot nastier in person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.79,0:20:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们该考虑延后任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we should consider postponing the mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.21,0:21:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这座岛有多远？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How far away is this island?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.01,0:21:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,80公里 也许更远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}50 miles, maybe more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.01,0:21:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,带我们靠近点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take us closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.51,0:21:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,想起飞就从这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna launch, you do it from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.34,0:21:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,中校 你们能穿越风暴吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you punch through that, Colonel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.05,0:21:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们的机会就是现在 - 穿过这个洞？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Our opening is now. - Through this hole right here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.47,0:21:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,对 是难得的低压气穴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's a rare low-pressure pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.23,0:21:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,朗达 我欣赏你的热忱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I appreciate your passion, Randa,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.35,0:21:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但身为控制机构的实地监督\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but as Field Supervisor of the controlling agency,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.48,0:21:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我建议中止 就这样 我们会中止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say we abort. That's it, we're gonna abort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.86,0:21:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好个明智决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wise call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.53,0:21:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,大地卫星的视察员 一定会被你的勇气激励\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure the Landsat inspector will be inspired by your courage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.19,0:21:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是被我的常识激励\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he'll be inspired by my common sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.20,0:21:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这不过是地图探勘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is only a map survey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.20,0:21:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,对于地表最后的未知区域之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To one of the last uncharted areas on the face of the Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.49,0:21:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你却因下雨放弃？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you wanna call it on account of rain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.04,0:21:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,想待在船上随你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay on the boat if you want to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.66,0:21:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,下次我们要等好几年才有这种机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could be years before we get another shot at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.87,0:21:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,听说你的单位 能够应付这种在暴天气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm told your unit is capable of handling inclement weather, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就让派克中校打破平局吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we leave it to Colonel Packard to break the tie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.42,0:21:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我打死不会搭上直升机的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no way I'm getting on that helicopter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.85,0:21:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要求武装直升机 他们不该知道原因吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did ask to arm those helicopters. Shouldn't they know why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.10,0:21:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,干麻？引起大惊小怪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? And raise an alarm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.90,0:22:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不过是以防万一 布鲁克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Purely a precaution, Brooks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.78,0:22:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.94,0:22:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,再2分钟起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two mikes till launch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.90,0:22:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,军队和平民登上指定飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Troops and civilians, board assigned aircraft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.41,0:22:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,再2分钟起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two mikes till launch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.58,0:22:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那老头让我们淌了什么混水？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the old man getting us into, Cole?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.59,0:22:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会害自己送命的 他是带头的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing he wouldn't do himself. He's taking the lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.63,0:22:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他不想念温暖的床吗？我很想念我的床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't he miss his bed? I miss my bed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.76,0:22:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想你的床吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you miss your bed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.14,0:22:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,科尔 你有床吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you even have a bed, Cole?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.72,0:22:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你有床吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a bed, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.43,0:22:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,查普曼 在会合点见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you at the rendezvous, Chapman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.14,0:22:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.98,0:22:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,1分30秒 重复 再1分30秒起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One mike 30. Repeat, one mike 30 to launch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.45,0:22:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,完成外物损伤检查 清空甲板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Complete FOD walkdown and clear the deck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.58,0:22:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,再1分钟起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One mike to launch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.17,0:23:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 电池？- 检查了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Battery? - Check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.33,0:23:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 发电机启动？- 检查了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Generator start? - Check, check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.42,0:23:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 引擎启动？- 检查三次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Engine start? - Check three times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.42,0:23:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,狐队长呼叫狐小队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Fox Leader to Fox Group.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.80,0:23:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,该是时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is time, once again,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.59,0:23:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,狮鹫和蚂蚁秀再次登场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the Griffin and ant show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.60,0:23:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,老样子 切记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As usual, remember,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.81,0:23:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,坐稳啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hold onto your butts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.31,0:23:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,注意 飞行员 准许起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention, pilots. You are cleared for takeoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.31,0:23:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,起飞 起飞 起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Launch, launch, launch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.80,0:23:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,战斗队形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Combat formation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.46,0:23:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,保持能见度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep visual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.22,0:23:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,狐5号 启航时通知我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox Five, let me know when you close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.18,0:23:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,狐5号就定位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox Five is in the slot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.35,0:23:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.98,0:24:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,狐小队 列队跟着我 一起行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox team, form up on me. Keep it together!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.19,0:24:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,大家冲了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.87,0:24:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,维持路线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maintain course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.87,0:24:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们什么场面没见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing we haven't done before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.87,0:24:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,"亲爱的比利"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Dear Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.75,0:24:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,"你是否曾经凝视飓风并决定…"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"You ever looked into a hurricane and decide,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.71,0:24:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,"也许我该直接冲进去？"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Maybe I should fly straight through it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.09,0:24:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"因为那即将发生了"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Because that's what's about to happen."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.72,0:24:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的比利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dear Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.93,0:24:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好抓紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might wanna hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.41,0:25:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,狐队长呼叫狐小队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox Leader to Fox Group.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.21,0:25:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,转为惯性导航\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Switch to inertial navigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.25,0:25:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,记住伊卡洛斯的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And remember the story of Icarus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.75,0:25:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他父亲给他蜡造的翅膀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose father gave him wings made of wax{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.55,0:25:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,并警告他别飞得太靠近太阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and warned him not to fly too close to the sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.89,0:25:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但他太兴奋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the exhilaration was too great,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.26,0:25:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,于是他愈飞愈高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so he flew higher and higher{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.22,0:25:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,直到太阳熔化了他的翅膀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until the sun melted his wings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.44,0:25:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他就落入海中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he fell into the sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.94,0:25:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,但美国陆军不是失职的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the United States Army is not an irresponsible father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.82,0:25:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他们给我们的翅膀是热炼冷钆的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So they gave us wings of white-hot, cold-rolled{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.91,0:25:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,宾州钢铁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pennsylvania steel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.74,0:25:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,保证不会熔化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guaranteed not to melt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.37,0:26:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 嘿 景色很美吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hey, that's pretty, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.30,0:26:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,贴近地表 低空飞行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's take them down, low and level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.01,0:27:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,狐队长呼叫狐小队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox Leader to Fox Group.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.97,0:27:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,分头调查各自的区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Split up, survey your zones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.55,0:27:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,狐7号 让大地卫星人员登陆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox Seven, put Landsat on deck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.22,0:27:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 狐队长 狐3号前往第6区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy, Fox Leader. Fox Three headed to Zone Six.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.73,0:27:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里放我们下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put us down over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.73,0:27:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,其他人跟着队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone else, stay with the team leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.36,0:27:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,把起落架移向3点钟方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move that gear to our three o'clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.69,0:27:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 动作快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, let's move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.76,0:28:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,准备投震源药包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready for seismic charges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.97,0:28:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.81,0:28:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,狐小队 可以投了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox Group, let it fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.27,0:28:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 狐3号 往正东方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy all, Fox Three. Heading 0-9-0.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.41,0:28:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我没看错吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you seeing what I'm seeing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.95,0:28:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,地震反应太激烈了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The seismic response is incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.63,0:28:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,朗达 你一定不会相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Randa, you're not gonna believe this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.01,0:28:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,岩床…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bedrock,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.13,0:28:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上是空的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's practically hollow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.31,0:28:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,注意前方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.33,0:29:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.54,0:29:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,保持警戎 狐5号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On guard, Fox Five!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.00,0:30:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,狐8号坠落 狐4号坠落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox Eight is down! Fox Four is down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.30,0:30:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,狐3号 请回复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Respond, Fox Three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.22,0:30:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.39,0:30:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,狐7号移往3点钟位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox Seven moving into position, three o'clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.89,0:30:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,有谁知道那是什么玩意吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does anybody know what that is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.73,0:30:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, man. God damn...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.23,0:30:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,红色降落区以西3公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three klicks west of Red LZ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.61,0:30:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,老天 我从没看过这种怪兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus! I've never seen anything like it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.07,0:30:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,设定周边300公尺 不要交战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set a perimeter of 300 meters. Do not engage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.44,0:30:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,了解 爬升1800公尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger. Climb 1,800.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.42,0:30:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那是猴子吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that a monkey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.71,0:30:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.59,0:30:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,谁回答我啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody talk to me, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.30,0:30:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,右转 往西南西 目视接近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn right, heading 2-5-0. Contact approach...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.64,0:30:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,狐队长呼叫狐小队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox Leader to Fox Group.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.18,0:30:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,形成周边 预备炮手位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Form a perimeter. Ready gunner positions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.31,0:31:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我的妈呀 看那玩意 吓死人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit! Look at that thing! I'm freaking out here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.23,0:31:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,狐队长呼叫狐小队 全力开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox Leader to Fox Group. Fire at will!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.65,0:31:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么鬼？- 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell is that? - I don't know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.59,0:31:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,马上撤离 撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull out now! Pull out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.80,0:31:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不是听命于你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't take orders from you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.97,0:31:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,快带我们离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get us the hell out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.13,0:31:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 狐9号坠落 - 哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fox Nine is down! - Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.64,0:31:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,狐6号 我们快失控了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox Six, we got nominal control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.29,0:31:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,要坠落了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are going down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.36,0:31:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,狐5号 这是狐队长 狐9号坠落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox Five, this is Fox Leader. Fox Nine is down,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.53,0:31:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,河弯以北1公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one klick north of river bend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.80,0:31:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,快派营救队 完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Insert recovery team. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.70,0:31:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,狐5号在空中盘旋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox Five is hovering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.20,0:31:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,有人着陆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got men going out the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.83,0:31:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要帮助 我需要…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need help here. I need...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.50,0:32:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.96,0:32:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉这个王八蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill this son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.55,0:32:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,进攻 我看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming in hot! I got eyes on it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.00,0:32:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,拉高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.18,0:32:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,准备冲击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brace for impact!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.07,0:32:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,求救 求救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mayday, mayday!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.45,0:32:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,往旁边跑 你白痴喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run to the side, you idiot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.93,0:32:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抓紧了 - 小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hang on! - Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.51,0:32:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.18,0:32:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,准备坠机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare to crash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.93,0:32:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,做好准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brace!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.90,0:33:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,狐队长坠落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox Leader is down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.36,0:33:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,狐5号回去接应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox Five inbound for pickup!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.19,0:33:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们看到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have him in sight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.61,0:33:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,撑住 派克中校 我们正赶过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold tight, Colonel Packard, we are on our way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.74,0:33:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,撑着 布里吉 我来救你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on, Briggs. I'm coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.42,0:33:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要坠落了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.80,0:33:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,重复 我们要坠落了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, we are going down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.22,0:33:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 立刻回答我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I want you to tell me something right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.64,0:33:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你爱你老妈吗 - 我爱她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you love your mama? - I love her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.43,0:33:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你多爱你老妈 - 我超爱我老妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How much do you love your mama? - I love my mama so much!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.85,0:35:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,呼叫所有单位 有人在空中吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calling all units! ls anybody airborne?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.35,0:35:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,重复 有人在空中吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, is anybody airborne?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.40,0:35:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都坠落了 每一架飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all down. Every one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.36,0:35:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在岛的南边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on the south side of the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.36,0:35:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,几公里外有一条河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a river a couple of klicks from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.49,0:35:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,沿着河堤就会到达北岸的撤出点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we stick to its banks, we'll make it to the exfil site on the north shore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.70,0:35:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢？所有直升机都坠落了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then what? All our choppers are down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.87,0:35:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想办法向船发信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll find a way to signal the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.54,0:35:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会派出搜救队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll send a search party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.42,0:35:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只要在撤离时间内到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just have to make it by the exit window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.38,0:35:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我该坐办公桌的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should be sitting at a desk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.71,0:35:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 大家都不明讲吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, wait, are we just not gonna talk about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.88,0:35:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜我们散落在 6到8公里的半径范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My best guess is we're scattered over a four to five mile radius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.59,0:35:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该往北 沿路找生还者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should head north and join anyone we find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.18,0:35:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.43,0:35:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在回答不出那个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know how to answer that question right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.39,0:35:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what that was either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.39,0:35:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是付你多少钱？希望值得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that money that they paid you? I hope you're worth it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.06,0:35:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,大家真的都不明讲？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're really not gonna talk about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.23,0:35:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这不正常吧？这种事平常不会发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know this is not normal, right? Stuff like that doesn't just happen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.36,0:36:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,狐队长呼叫狐小队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Fox Leader to Fox Group!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.28,0:36:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,听到的人快回复 完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody with ears, come back. Respond. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.03,0:36:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,狐队长 查普曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox, Chapman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.74,0:36:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,狐6号 查普曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox Six, Chapman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.20,0:36:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,再说一次你的座标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say again, your last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.41,0:36:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,西方4公里 最高峰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four klicks west, highest peak...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.00,0:36:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,NA300 完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}November Alpha 300. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.59,0:36:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,了解 查普曼 西方最高山峰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that, Chapman. West highest mountain peak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.75,0:36:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.92,0:36:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,狐6号确认 我们在海种马直升机旁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox Six confirm, we're at the Sea Stallion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.72,0:36:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,查普曼 留在原地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chapman, hold your position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.22,0:36:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去找你 海种马直升机上的弹药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll come to you. There's enough munitions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.14,0:36:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,足以杀掉那玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on that Sea Stallion to kill this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.14,0:36:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,勘测你的周边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Survey your perimeter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.06,0:36:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,找出可能的埋伏地点 完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Locate possible ambush sites. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.10,0:36:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,查普曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chapman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.57,0:36:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,罗里斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reles,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.73,0:36:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在休息 还是可以走了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}taking an R and R day, or you good to go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.53,0:36:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 我可以走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good to go, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.85,0:36:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,跟上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.45,0:36:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,查普曼呼叫所有岗位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chapman to all stations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.12,0:36:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,侦察环境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recon environment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.51,0:37:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,科尔 你有什么毛病？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cole, what's wrong with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.14,0:37:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么现在还有胃口？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you even got an appetite right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.14,0:37:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,进食是为了存活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eating's for the living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.44,0:37:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚被一只摩天楼大的猴子痛宰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just got taken down by a monkey the size of a building!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.48,0:37:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.98,0:37:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那是很不寻常的遭遇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was an unconventional encounter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.65,0:37:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你没吓到头壳坏掉吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that really all your brain telling itself right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.16,0:37:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没有战术优先次序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no tactical precedence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.62,0:37:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,在这种情况下我们尽力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did the best we could in the situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.00,0:37:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,狮鹫连\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Griffin C0.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.17,0:37:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,谢天谢地你们没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God you guys are okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.72,0:37:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你 长官 - 我们没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good to see you, sir. - We're all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.97,0:37:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下多少人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many left?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.47,0:37:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,7人生还\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven survivors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.27,0:37:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,7人确认阵亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven confirmed KIA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.27,0:37:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,贾勒塔 萨拉夫和哈吉斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Galleta, Saraf, and Hodges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.19,0:37:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,史利哥和其他人下落不明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slivko and the rest are unknown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.04,0:38:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,朗达在哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Randa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.25,0:38:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.67,0:38:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我很好 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.96,0:38:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那好 很高兴听到 我还担心了一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Glad to hear it. I was worried about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.80,0:38:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你要从实招来所有我不知道的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are going to tell me everything I don't know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.05,0:38:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,否则我会轰了你的脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or I'm gonna blow your head off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.27,0:38:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,怪兽确实存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monsters exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.56,0:38:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,废话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.44,0:38:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没人相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody believed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.40,0:38:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天 我被当成怪胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yesterday, I was a crackpot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.90,0:38:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但今天…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But today...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.72,0:38:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,所以这从来就跟地质无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this was never about geology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.03,0:38:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你们投震源药包是要逼出怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dropped those charges to flush something out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.58,0:38:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么来头？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.74,0:38:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你听过美国军舰劳顿号吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard of the USS Lawton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.37,0:38:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,民众也没听过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither did the public.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.17,0:39:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那艘船上有一千名年轻人 我是唯一的律存者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of a thousand young men on that ship, I was the only survivor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.38,0:39:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他们跟我家人说船在战役中沉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They told my family she was sunk in battle,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.63,0:39:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但我知道我看到什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I know what I saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.96,0:39:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,它毫无良心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It had no conscience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.63,0:39:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不讲道理 只是破坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No reasoning, just destroy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.09,0:39:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我花了过去30年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spent the last 30 years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.06,0:39:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,试图证明那天我得知的真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}trying to prove the truth of what I learned that day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.89,0:39:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,地球不属于我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This planet doesn't belong to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.73,0:39:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,古老物种早在人类之前就拥有地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ancient species owned this earth long before mankind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.27,0:39:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们继续保持鸵鸟的心态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if we keep our heads buried in the sand,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.53,0:39:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,它们就会今回地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they will take it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.36,0:39:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我的机构名为帝王计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My agency is known as Monarch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.24,0:39:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们专精猎捕巨大不明陆栖生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We specialize in the hunt for Massive Unidentified Terrestrial Organisms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.08,0:39:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你早就知道那个怪物在这里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew that thing was out here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.24,0:39:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾你的属下罹难 我是真心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry for your men, Colonel, I truly am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.58,0:39:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,送我们回家 带着证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get us home, with proof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.09,0:39:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就能派来装甲部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we can send the cavalry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.23,0:39:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是装甲部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the cavalry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.23,0:40:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这称为地空说理论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's called the Hollow Earth theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.94,0:40:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,朗达雇用我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Randa hired me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.73,0:40:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我写了一篇论文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because I wrote a paper{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.48,0:40:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,想证实多数人认为是 异想天开的概念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}substantiating what most people think is a crackpot idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.74,0:40:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,巨大的地下空间确实存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That there are these massive underground spaces{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.41,0:40:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 与表面也界隔离 - 通道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- isolated from the surface world. - Passageways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.62,0:40:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,朗达相信这座岛可能就是其一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Randa believed this island may be one of those.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.45,0:40:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,地底不明生物的出没点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An emergence point for whatever lives below.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.08,0:40:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,像是刚才看到的古老物种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ancient species like what we just saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.71,0:40:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为他疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought he was out of his mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.38,0:40:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我是史利哥 有听到吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Slivko. Do you read?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.00,0:40:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.17,0:40:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要往北去撤出点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're headed north to the exfil location.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.17,0:40:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这里每个人都看起来太冷静了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone here seems way too calm right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.09,0:40:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,收到没？有人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you copy? Anybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.76,0:40:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,超出接收范围 史利哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're out of range, Slivko.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.14,0:40:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.31,0:40:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,等留到接近团队时再用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save it for when we get closer to the group.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.86,0:40:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,谁都不准动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.07,0:40:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.92,0:41:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 史利哥 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Slivko. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.10,0:41:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.79,0:41:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人不是白白牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These men did not die in vain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.17,0:41:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我对天发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear to God,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.34,0:41:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不会死不瞑目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}their deaths will not go unanswered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.89,0:41:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,快去找查普曼和那些弹药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now let's get to Chapman and those munitions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.19,0:42:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你听过老鼠 狮子和尖刺的故事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever heard the story of the mouse, the lion, and the thorn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.36,0:42:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.61,0:42:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就懂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.99,0:42:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,以免我们又撞见那只猩猩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In case we ever see that primate again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.99,0:42:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你的版本是老鼠把狮子脚掌的刺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do know that story is about a mouse becoming friends with the lion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.12,0:42:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,拔出来后 它们成为好朋友吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after taking the thorn out of his paw though, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.83,0:42:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,才不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.46,0:42:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,老鼠用刺杀死狮子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mouse kills the lion with the thorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.25,0:42:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,谁告诉你的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who told you that, Cole?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.80,0:42:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.05,0:42:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,怪不得你这么天真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That actually explains a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.58,0:43:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,小心 不妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out! Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.17,0:43:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小心 - 那是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watch out! - What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.67,0:43:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小心后方 - 上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watch your six! - Up above!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.84,0:43:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在树上 - 朝上开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Up in the trees! - Guns up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.97,0:43:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,科尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.39,0:43:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 米尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No,no! - Mills!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.31,0:43:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会救你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.56,0:43:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我瞄不准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't get a shot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.44,0:43:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,砍断脚 砍断它的脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut the legs! Cut it off at the legs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.26,0:44:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.58,0:44:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,别再想了 快上路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shake it off, guys! Let's move out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.34,0:44:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,跟紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.22,0:44:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.35,0:45:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,注意后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Behind you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.52,0:45:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,大家保持冷静 保持冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody, stay calm. Stay calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.73,0:45:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,康拉德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Conrad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.98,0:45:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,后退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.94,0:45:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大伙儿 - 别靠近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Guys. - Stop, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.61,0:45:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇 哇 哇 - 别靠近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoa, whoa, whoa! - Stop, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.36,0:45:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谁都不准开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.21,0:46:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 不必动枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. No need for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.92,0:46:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,别激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.26,0:46:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 镇定下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody, keep your wigs on now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.01,0:46:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.89,0:46:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说有人来了我还不信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't believe it when they said you were coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.14,0:46:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我整晚没睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was up all night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.39,0:46:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就想着我和军平梦到的这一刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just thinking about how me and Gunpei dreamed of this moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.31,0:46:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,如今实现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now here it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.69,0:46:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,28年又11个月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}28 years, 11 months{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.02,0:46:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,8次尝试回归世界都失败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and eight failed attempts to get back to the world,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.65,0:46:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,结果却是你们来找我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and instead the world comes to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.45,0:46:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不是很爆笑吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't that a crack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.53,0:46:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他们从不笑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They never smile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.66,0:46:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里坠机？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you crash here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.54,0:46:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了 小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Sorry, miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.54,0:46:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,45步兵团的汉克·马洛中尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant Hank Marlow of the 45th.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.96,0:46:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,为了你穿上旧飞行装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put the old flight suit on for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.88,0:46:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你美多了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are more beautiful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.63,0:46:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,比起热狗配啤酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than a hot dog and a beer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.38,0:46:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,在里格利球场的开慕日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at Wrigley Field on opening day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.52,0:46:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但你是真实的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.69,0:47:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.11,0:47:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我就说吧 我不是告诉你们了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you. Didn't I tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.20,0:47:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.53,0:47:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,"不要紧的"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"it's fine."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.37,0:47:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这样才对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.00,0:47:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,外头有怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something out there, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.75,0:47:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,外头怪物可多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, there's a lot out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.58,0:47:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,过来 我们快回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, come on. We gotta get home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.84,0:47:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上最好别在外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't wanna be out here at night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.01,0:50:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你们可能注意到 这座岛上有许多怪事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You probably noticed a lot of weird things on this island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.47,0:50:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,只要待在这群人的部落 我们就会没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as we stay in here where the people live, we'll be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.31,0:50:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那道墙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That wall,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.06,0:50:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是为了阻档那只怪兽？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that supposed to keep out that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.49,0:50:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他们想阻档的不是它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he's not the one they're trying to keep out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.78,0:50:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.20,0:50:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人住在树上 不像我们住在地面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These people live up on top of the trees while we're down on the roots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.78,0:50:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,有些人甚至看不出变老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of them don't even seem to age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.79,0:50:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没有犯罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no crime,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.33,0:50:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,没有私人财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no personal property.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.62,0:50:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不在乎那一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're past all that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.89,0:51:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.77,0:51:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, good news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.81,0:51:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说你们能住这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say you can shack up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.61,0:51:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我没听到他们说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't hear them say anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.57,0:51:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他们话不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, they don't speak too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.82,0:51:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你待得跟我一样久 你就会了解 你会明白的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you've been here as long as I have, you start to understand. You'll see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.95,0:51:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. Wait, wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.28,0:51:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能留下 我们要离开这座岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't stay here. We have to get off the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.95,0:51:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有日子要过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have lives. I have a life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.66,0:51:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,尼伟斯 现在时机不对 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nieves, now is not the time. All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.71,0:51:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,踏上这里 就别想走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What lands here tends to stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.96,0:51:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,就我所知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As far as I can tell,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.29,0:51:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这艘船比我早10年冲上岸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this ship washed up about 10 years before I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.34,0:51:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你1944年就在这里？- 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You've been here since '44? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.97,0:51:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那场战争的结果呢？我们赢了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened with the war? Did we win?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.22,0:51:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哪场战争？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.47,0:51:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 那说得通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-huh. That makes sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.31,0:51:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他们的圣地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is all hallowed ground to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.56,0:51:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,所以不想断手的人 就别乱碰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if you like your hands, don't touch anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.58,0:52:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真不得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.47,0:52:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,以他们的说法 几千年来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way they tell it, for thousands of years,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.05,0:52:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这座岛上的人活在恐惧中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the people on this island lived in fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.27,0:52:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,还真是害怕了很久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a hell of a long time to be scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.44,0:52:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,然后有一天 最诡异的事发生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then, one day, the damnedest thing happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.57,0:52:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他们害怕的一些怪兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of the things they were afraid of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.61,0:52:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,开始保护他们不被其他怪兽吃掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}started protecting them against the things that were eating them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.91,0:52:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但凡事都不是永恒的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But nothing lasts forever, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.71,0:52:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在这里奉杷最后的救世主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this is where they honor the last of their saviors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.97,0:53:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.26,0:53:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那是金刚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Kong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.52,0:53:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他是这里的霸主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's king around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.94,0:53:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人供他为神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's God to these people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.78,0:53:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,金刚是个好霸主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kong's a pretty good king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.32,0:53:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,习惯独来独往\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keeps to himself mostly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.20,0:53:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他的家 我们只是客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is his home. We're just guests here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.54,0:53:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,但谁会去别人家里敌丢炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you don't go into someone's house and start dropping bombs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.88,0:53:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你想够挑起争战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless you're picking a fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.25,0:53:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不是金刚杀了你朋友？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wasn't Kong the one who killed your friend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.22,0:53:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.01,0:53:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那种怪兽杀的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of them did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.93,0:53:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,金刚是这座岛上的神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kong's god on the island,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.77,0:53:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但在我们之下有恶魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the devils live below us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.23,0:53:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,叫什么来着？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what are they called?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.61,0:53:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,伊维族不会说出它们的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lwis won't speak their name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.29,0:54:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但我称它们骷髅爬兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I call them Skull-crawlers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.65,0:54:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.36,0:54:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,因为听起来特厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause it sounds neat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.49,0:54:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我临时编出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Look, I just made that name up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.08,0:54:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,想吓你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to scare you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.33,0:54:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那个名称还不赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine calling them that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.54,0:54:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说呢？- 同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you cool with that? - Yeah...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.91,0:54:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢那个名称 - 感觉是个好名称\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I like the name, so... - That seems like a great name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.79,0:54:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没说出过那个名称\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never said that name out loud before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.33,0:54:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,现在说出来感觉很蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it sounds stupid now that I say it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.54,0:54:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你们想怎么叫都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You call them whatever you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.55,0:54:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是一种大蜥蜴 很凶猛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're big lizard things. Nasty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.05,0:54:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,来自地底深处的裂缝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They come from the vents deep down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.05,0:54:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,难怪金刚会抓在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why Kong got so mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.52,0:54:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那些炸弹会唤醒其中几只\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those bombs woke up a bunch of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.02,0:54:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 你们很幸运金刚也在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell you what. You're lucky he's out there, too,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.52,0:54:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,否则你们活不到现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or you wouldn't have made it this far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.23,0:54:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,它们是狡猾的混蛋 残暴至极\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're crafty bastards. Mean as hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.87,0:54:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,只要是小只的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, he can handle them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.12,0:54:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,金刚就对付得了它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as long as he gets to them when they're still small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.04,0:55:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会想要唤醒那只大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't wanna wake up the big one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.21,0:55:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有多大？- 比较大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How big is it? - It's bigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.04,0:55:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,消灭了它的全家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wiped out his whole family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.01,0:55:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,金刚是同类中仅存的 但它仍在成长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kong's the last of his kind, but he's still growing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.80,0:55:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你们最好希望它是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you better hope he does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.47,0:55:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,因为伊维族说一旦金刚不在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because the lwis say once Kong goes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.59,0:55:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那只大恶魔就会出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then the big one comes up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.35,0:55:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是大祸临头的时刻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it's, "Goodnight, lrene."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.93,0:55:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 有一支燃料补给队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, there's a refueling team{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.85,0:55:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,3天后会抵达这座岛的北边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}coming to the north end of the island in three days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.56,0:55:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该跟我们来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should come with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.27,0:55:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,到岛的北边？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the north end of the island?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.24,0:55:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.45,0:55:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在3天内？- 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- In three days? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.16,0:55:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能在3天内到达北边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't get to the north end in three days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.71,0:55:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能 死心吧 别作梦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's impossible. That's it. No way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.50,0:55:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,至少徒步是不可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least not on foot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.83,0:56:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那只鸟丑爆了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is one ugly ass bird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.05,0:56:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的比利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dear Billy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.51,0:56:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方糟透了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this place is hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.64,0:56:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,怪兽确实存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And monsters exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.47,0:56:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,在床底下签着薪水条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Under beds and signing paychecks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.48,0:56:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别闹了 - 这似是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, man. - Seems like{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.98,0:56:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,看来他似乎想去杀那只猩猩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe he wants to go kill that ape{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.81,0:56:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是让我们离开这座岛 好咧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}instead of getting us off this island? Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.77,0:56:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来不来得及？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we even gonna make it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.98,0:56:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来得及什么？- 到撤出点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Make what? - The exfil!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.57,0:56:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要在3天内到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta be there in three days!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.36,0:56:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会赶到 来得及的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll make it. We're gonna make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.90,0:56:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但要是查普曼出事…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but, Cole, what happens if Chapman's not...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.53,0:56:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,中校说他在那里 他就在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Colonel said he's there, he's there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.54,0:57:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们差一点就… 让这启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were this close to getting it working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.67,0:57:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我和军平打算动身去外海 设法回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me and Gunpei were gonna take off for the open sea, try to get home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.21,0:57:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他在那时被怪兽杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's when one of them things got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.22,0:57:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,船在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There she is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.65,0:57:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,还真不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's lovely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.98,0:57:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,算你有眼光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're damn right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.99,0:57:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意浮得起来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does this thing even float?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.20,0:57:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我和军平花了6年人生建造这艘船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me and Gunpei spent six years of our lives building this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.79,0:57:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这是灰狐号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's called the Grey Fox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.88,0:57:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,它浮得起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she floats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.26,0:58:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,引擎零件取自我P51战机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pulled the engine parts from my P-51{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.22,0:58:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,和他的零使战机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and his old Zero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.89,0:58:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,某天在海滩发现一架波音轰炸机 挺管用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Found a B-29 on the beach one day. That was something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.44,0:58:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你别逗了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.19,0:58:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意看起来会让人得破伤风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That thing looks like it's made out of pure tetanus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.07,0:58:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这的确看起来不起眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know she ain't pretty to look at,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.74,0:58:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,多了人手帮忙 包准能修好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's nothing a couple of extra hands can't fix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.45,0:58:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你们有更好的点子 我建议我们快干活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you got a better idea, I suggest we get cracking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.04,0:58:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.76,1:00:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.24,1:01:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,看那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, would you look at that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.54,1:01:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,它流血了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It bleeds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.33,1:01:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这 - 是我们干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wha... - We did that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.29,1:01:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要跟查普曼会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We hook up with Chapman,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.21,1:01:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那架海种马直升机上有足够的弹药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's enough munitions on that downed Sea Stallion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.96,1:01:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,能终结它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to finish the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.81,1:01:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,太壮观了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magnificent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.02,1:01:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,知道为何我带这个却不带M16 ？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know why I carry this instead of an M-16?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.90,1:01:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,从为越南人民军而战的农夫手上抢来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took it off a farmer fighting for the NVA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.77,1:01:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一铲平他的村落他就投降了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He surrendered right after we leveled his village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.11,1:01:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他50岁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was 50 years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.82,1:01:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,说在我们出现前 他根本没看过枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Said he'd never even seen a gun till we showed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.74,1:01:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,有时 敌人并不存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes, an enemy doesn't exist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.24,1:01:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你紧追着假想敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}till you go looking for one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.79,1:01:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,当敌人出现在你门口时又怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happens when they show up on your doorstep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.66,1:01:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是会拿着他的枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll still have his gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.00,1:01:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,士兵 祝好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Best of luck with that, soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.47,1:02:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我们有48小时赶到北岸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. So, we've got 48 hours to make it to the north shore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.56,1:02:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,史利哥 知道你在修什么吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slivko, do you know what you're doing back there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.35,1:02:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 我爸是技师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! My pop's a mechanic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.10,1:02:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,若修不好 他会不认我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I can't fix this, he'll disown me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.69,1:02:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他还能再看到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he ever sees me again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.82,1:02:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,暂停一下 英国佬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold the phone there, Churchill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.40,1:02:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,俄罗斯是我们的同盟国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Russia was our ally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.69,1:02:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说我们正在跟他们作战？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you're saying we're at war with them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.49,1:02:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,比较像是冷战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's more of a cold war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.41,1:02:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,冷战是指…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cold war like{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.87,1:02:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,夏天不开战吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they take the summers off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.49,1:02:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那小熊队呢 赢了也界大赛吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the Cubs? The Cubs win a World Series yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.16,1:02:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,小熊队？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Cubs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.33,1:02:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 差得可远了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, not even close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.67,1:02:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们有强过吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were they ever good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.88,1:02:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,正好是我的球队 你哪里人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happens to be my team. Where are you from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.54,1:02:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 底特律 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Detroit. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.93,1:02:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好 老虎队 他们今年赢了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, yeah, the Tigers. Did they win at all this year?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.01,1:02:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 我怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know. - I doubt it. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.93,1:02:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我永远押小熊赢老虎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd pick the Cubbies over the Tigers any day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.68,1:02:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得老虎和小熊对打谁会赢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who do you think would win in a fight? A tiger or a cub?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.72,1:02:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,老虎会赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A tiger would win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.08,1:02:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,对 因为小熊是幼熊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, because a cub is a baby bear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.52,1:02:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,成年的老虎能吃掉幼熊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A full-grown tiger can eat a baby bear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.36,1:03:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,要多动脑筋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just gotta think it through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.82,1:03:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,人类也登上月球了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We also put a man on the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.53,1:03:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No kidding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.40,1:03:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他们做了什么 把人丢在那里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did they do? Just leave him up there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.32,1:03:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他要吃什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he eating?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.03,1:03:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,国珍 罐头食品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tang. Spam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.62,1:03:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 快天黑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, we're losing daylight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.09,1:03:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,狐队长 我是查普曼 完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox Leader, this is Chapman, over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.59,1:03:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,狐队长 我是查普曼 完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox Leader, this is Chapman, over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.89,1:03:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的比利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dear Billy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.23,1:03:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,有时人生就是会给你致命一击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes, life just punch you in the balls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.32,1:03:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.12,1:04:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这是哪门子音乐？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of music is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.29,1:04:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,摇摆乐怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to swing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.83,1:04:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,班尼·古德曼？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Benny Goodman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.62,1:04:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你好像时空旅行者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're like a time-traveler, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.17,1:04:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,听好了 这才是新的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling you, this is the new sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.38,1:04:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道我剃了须会像谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if I'm gonna like whoever's under this beard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.05,1:04:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你说的那船 能在36小时内带我们到上游\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really hope that thing you call a boat can get us upriver in 36 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.64,1:05:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们错过时机 我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because if we miss that window, we're,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.48,1:05:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,真的就要吃土了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}literally, up a creek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.31,1:05:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我最初写那篇地空说的论文时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I first wrote that paper on the Hollow Earth theory,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.02,1:05:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,整个委员会都放声大笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the whole committee laughed out loud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.07,1:05:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,除了朗达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not Randa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.90,1:05:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他是唯一把我当一回事的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one guy in the crowd who actually took me seriously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.49,1:05:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那种感觉很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It felt good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.12,1:05:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但他说地球充满怪兽时 我以为他疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I thought he was crazy when he said the earth was full of monsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.75,1:05:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我分不清我在说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't tell when I'm talking{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.54,1:05:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 或没在说话 - 你在说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- or when I'm not talking. - You're talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.33,1:05:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Am I? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.50,1:05:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我在说话？- 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm talking? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.17,1:05:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你的嘴巴在动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mouth is moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.50,1:05:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.67,1:05:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我会在半夜刺杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna stab you by the end of the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.34,1:05:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.51,1:05:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,开玩笑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.93,1:05:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,如果船发动不了 就改搭火车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the boat doesn't work, we'll just take the train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.85,1:05:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,最危险的地方始终最美丽 很怪吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't it odd the most dangerous places are always the most beautiful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.16,1:05:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我想拍一张长时曝光的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to take a long-exposure photograph,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.11,1:05:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但我的闪光灯坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but my flashlight broke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.70,1:05:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,试试这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.53,1:05:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.29,1:06:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 皇家空军？- 是我爸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Royal Air Force? - It was my father's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.46,1:06:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他出发去打纳粹时从火车上扔给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He threw it to me from the train as he rolled off to fight the Nazis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.67,1:06:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他就像是我的约翰·韦恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was like John Wayne to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.21,1:06:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,某种神话的英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some kind of mythic hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.26,1:06:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他有回来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he come back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.93,1:06:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他的飞机坠落在汉堡附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His plane went down near Hamburg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.76,1:06:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他们搜寻他几个月但…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They searched for him for months but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.77,1:06:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我想没人会从战场回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose no man comes home from war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.73,1:06:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,心是回不来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.24,1:06:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,米尔斯 别打混了 我要去检查周边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mills, quit dicking around. I'm going on perimeter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.42,1:06:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,派克中校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel Packard,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.05,1:07:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,前往坠机地点的任务并不明智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this mission to the crash site is folly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.14,1:07:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我能理解你寻人心切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand going after your man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.64,1:07:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,但除此之外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the rest of it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.81,1:07:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我们能力所及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is beyond us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.90,1:07:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你不喜欢我的处事方式？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't like the way I'm running things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.82,1:07:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,想走人随你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know where the door is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.61,1:07:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你促成这次行动 硬闯这片禁地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You set this in motion when you put this place on the map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.08,1:07:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但我绝不会临阵脱逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I will not cut and run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.62,1:07:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到敌人绝不放过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know an enemy when I see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.15,1:08:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人的名字是和军平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This man's name was Gunpei lkari.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.66,1:08:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但只要脱去制服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you take away the uniforms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.16,1:08:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,还有战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the war...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.00,1:08:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他成为我的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He became my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.50,1:08:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们发誓绝对不会丢下对方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we swore we'd never leave each other behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.68,1:08:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们离开这座岛吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get off this island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.82,1:08:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,还没啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.19,1:08:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把油加满 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Prime the lines. - Yeah, yeah, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.53,1:08:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,搞定了 出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wind it up, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.09,1:08:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,继续转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.70,1:08:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,第三次就会成功 加油 加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Third time's the charm. Here we go. Here we go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.04,1:08:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,加把劲 加把劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, let's go, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.17,1:08:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.17,1:08:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.88,1:09:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶 发动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.45,1:09:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,该是道别的时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess this is goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.37,1:09:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.42,1:09:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们有来芝加哥 记得找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're ever in Chicago, look me up, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.76,1:11:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,拿来 让我帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, no. Let me help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.18,1:11:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,男人就该… 啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man's gotta do what... Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.10,1:11:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.27,1:11:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.69,1:11:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,让我来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.69,1:11:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你该在图书馆认识我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should see me in the library.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.40,1:11:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我有老婆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.24,1:11:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经有老婆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had a wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.45,1:11:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,老婆还在吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.12,1:11:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经不得而知了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess I don't know anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.37,1:11:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在我参战前结婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got hitched right before I deployed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.62,1:11:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我坠机的前一天收到电报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got a telegram from her the day before I got shot down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.21,1:11:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,她说我们的儿子刚出生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said we just had our baby boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.21,1:11:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a son out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.09,1:11:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没见过的成年人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grown man I've never met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.21,1:11:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,她肯定以为你挂点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, she definitely thinks you're dead, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.22,1:11:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.59,1:11:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是说说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.22,1:11:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,很难说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.81,1:11:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,有些人就是很能等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd be surprised how long people wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.93,1:11:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 我不指望他们等待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, truth is, I don't expect them to be waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.10,1:12:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,反正我会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be fine either way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.15,1:12:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想有机会见到他们一面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want one last chance to see them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.19,1:12:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那样我就满足了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'd be good enough for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.24,1:12:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会送你回家的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna get you home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.41,1:12:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,狐5号 回复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox Five, come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.82,1:12:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那里有人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there anyone out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.07,1:12:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这是狐5号 我们听到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! This is Fox Five. We hear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.38,1:12:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我们在船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! We're on a boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.03,1:12:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们在船上 在河上往北 - 船？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're on a boat headed up north on a river. - A boat'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.79,1:12:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哪弄来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd y'all get a boat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.82,1:12:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们遇到一个疯颠的圣诞老人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We met this, like, crazy Santa Claus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.79,1:12:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,来自二战的时空旅行者 你们会见到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}time-traveler guy from World War ll. You'll meet him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.09,1:12:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你们弄来什么船？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of boat y'all got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.50,1:12:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,其实比较像飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's more of, like, a plane than a boat, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.42,1:12:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就称"飞机船"好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's call it a "ploat."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.84,1:12:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在飞机船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on a ploat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.01,1:12:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,史利哥 我们需要他们的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need their location, Slivko.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.51,1:12:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,发射信号弹 让我们找到你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send up a flare so we can find you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.60,1:12:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,了解 狐5号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that, Fox Five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.43,1:12:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,要发射了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire in the hole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.02,1:12:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.70,1:12:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.53,1:12:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,重复 看到了 在我们北方2公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, we have a visual. Two klicks to our north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.03,1:12:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,了解 狐5号 狐1号结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that, Fox Five. Fox One out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.12,1:12:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,1 小时后在集合点会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rendezvous point, one hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.12,1:12:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,上路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mount up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.29,1:12:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,船装得下所有人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we fit everybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.54,1:13:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.25,1:13:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We 're going home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.13,1:13:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,给我下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.64,1:13:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.60,1:13:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.11,1:13:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,拿好各自的装备 我们要继续移动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody, grab your gear. We have to keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.19,1:13:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们上岸跟派克会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll go ashore, meet up with Packard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.15,1:13:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Wait a minute! Wait a minute!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.65,1:13:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,没人要说点什么 刚才…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is nobody gonna say anything about the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.03,1:13:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他挂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.20,1:13:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,回不来了 没啥好说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he ain't coming back. There's nothing to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.83,1:13:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.00,1:13:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,信号弹在北方2公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their flare was only two klicks north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.38,1:13:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他们应该很快会到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They should be here soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.97,1:13:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,除非被比我们大的怪物吃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless they were eaten by something that's bigger than us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.68,1:14:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.10,1:14:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,史利哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slivko!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.77,1:14:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你喝屁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought you were taking a dirt nap by now, Slivko.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.06,1:14:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到能再见到你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never thought I'd see you guys again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.52,1:14:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我以为你疯了 - 你看到的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I thought you were crazy. - I wish I had been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.90,1:14:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还剩多少人？- 你看到就是全部的人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's your count? - What you see is what I got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.15,1:14:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也失去一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lost one, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.36,1:14:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you, fellas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.20,1:14:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这是何方神圣？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.53,1:14:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们让他搭便车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We picked up a hitchhiker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.20,1:14:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,汉克·马洛上尉 第15航空队第45中队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant Hank Marlow of the 45th Pursuit Squadron of the 15th.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.37,1:14:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你从二战就在这里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been here since World War II?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.54,1:14:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 我错过阅兵了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir. I miss the parade?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.38,1:14:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,真要命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be damned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.71,1:14:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,敬礼 中尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Snap to, Lieutenant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.38,1:14:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会送他回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna get him home, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.21,1:14:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,只要沿着这条河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we follow this river,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.42,1:14:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,赶上了船 就能及时到达北岸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll make it to the boat, and we'll make it to the north shore in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.72,1:14:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That sounds good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.43,1:14:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们还不能离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we're not leaving yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.89,1:14:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一人失踪 康拉德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still got a man out there, Conrad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.22,1:14:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 还有一人个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a second. You got someone out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.73,1:14:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,查普曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chapman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.89,1:14:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他在坠落的海种马旁 在西边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's with the downed Sea Stallion just west of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.02,1:14:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,西边？我们不能往西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}West? We can't go west!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.15,1:14:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那些骷髅爬兽就住那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where the skull things live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.90,1:14:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,当地有句古谚:"东方棒棒哒 西方糟透了"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have an old saying here. "East is best, west is worst!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.40,1:14:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这样说是有道理的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why we say it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.74,1:14:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,至于西南…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, southwest...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.61,1:14:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,还可以商量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could talk about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.95,1:15:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但要往西的话需要更多枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're gonna need a lot more guns if you're gonna go west.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.83,1:15:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 我们应该听马洛的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys. I think that we should listen to Marlow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.66,1:15:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这太疯狂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.04,1:15:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.63,1:15:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你的工作是找到失踪的人 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your job is finding lost men, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.63,1:15:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你说了算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.88,1:15:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果我们到达那里他却不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if we reach that position and he's not there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.05,1:15:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不会派人搜索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we don't send out a search party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.30,1:15:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,要在傍晚前会回来这里 懂吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're back here by nightfall, understood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.43,1:15:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,在24小时内得赶到岛的另一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In 24 hours, we have to be on the other side of this island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.72,1:15:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,了解 听得一清二楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that. Hear you loud and clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.39,1:15:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你们听到了 10分钟后出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, you heard the man. Moving out in 10.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.48,1:15:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,真是一群好兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a good group of boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.23,1:15:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都会一起死在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all gonna die together out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.32,1:15:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我承认跟你们这群兄弟 一起死还不赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a good group of boys to die with, I'll tell you that much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.46,1:15:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不该来这里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't have come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.45,1:15:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,记得提醒我 这是个馊主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget to tell me this is a bad idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.12,1:15:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个馊主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a bad idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.36,1:16:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你们闻到了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you smell that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.32,1:16:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那是死亡的味道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.04,1:16:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这到底是什么地方？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.00,1:16:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这是金刚父母的遗骸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what's left of Kong's parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.50,1:16:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我拍了够多敌葬岗 算是认得出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've taken enough photos of mass graves to recognize one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.00,1:16:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,坠机地点在这座山谷的另一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The crash site's just on the other side of this valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.55,1:16:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会穿过 爬上西方的最高点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll cross through and make it to the highest point west.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.18,1:16:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方是禁地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place is a real no-no, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.68,1:16:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要立刻去北边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to be going to the north side right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.26,1:16:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你请便 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're welcome to do that, my man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.06,1:16:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,自己去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.06,1:16:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会丢下杰克 谁会跟我去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not leaving Jack out there. Now, who's with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.19,1:16:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会成功的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.90,1:16:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,对极了 我们会成功的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're mighty right, we can make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.19,1:17:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,机灵点 睁大眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, stay sharp. Keep an eye out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.53,1:17:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里只待28年 老子懂什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've only been here 28 years. What do I know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.90,1:17:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,科尔 没时间了 把烟熄掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cole, we don't got time for that, man. Put the cigarette out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.25,1:17:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,小心那些烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch those fumes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.21,1:18:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Idiots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.88,1:18:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 我们要赶快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. We gotta move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.27,1:18:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,快逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.77,1:18:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,躲在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.11,1:18:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.09,1:18:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我就说这鬼地方是禁忌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you this damn place was a no-no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.73,1:18:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.34,1:19:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.01,1:19:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,队伍跟着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rally on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.51,1:19:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,整队 整队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rally up! Rally up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.06,1:19:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,谁去保护那些平民 赶快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody cover the civilians' six. Let's move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.03,1:19:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.12,1:19:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,朗达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Randal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.25,1:20:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,预备机关枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set up the 50!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.01,1:20:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.62,1:21:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,拿喷火器 喷个痛快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring the torch! Do your thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.90,1:21:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,史利哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slivko!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.44,1:21:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有毒气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.21,1:22:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,马洛 剑给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marlow! Sword!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.86,1:22:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,史利哥 等我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slivko, hang on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.70,1:22:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,怪兽在移动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing's moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.07,1:23:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 中校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, look, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.07,1:23:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能阶级比我高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may outrank me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.24,1:23:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但我待在这里可久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I've been here a hell of a lot longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.08,1:23:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我郑重告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm telling you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.58,1:23:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才打爆我们的玩意 只是刚开始的一只\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that thing that just shredded us was only the first of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.08,1:23:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们闯入它们的地盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we're on their turf,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.83,1:23:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要立马回头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we need to turn back toot sweet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.75,1:23:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,只要查普曼还在那里就不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not as long as Chapman's still out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.84,1:23:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾 派克中校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Colonel Packard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.76,1:23:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,查普曼死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chapman is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.27,1:23:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,计划不变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't change a thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.68,1:23:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们仍会去坠机地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're still going to that crash site.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.14,1:23:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底想在那里找到什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's at that crash site that you want so badly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.93,1:23:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,武器 足以干掉它的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weapons! Enough to kill it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.71,1:23:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 金刚没杀查普曼 - 但他杀了这些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kong didn't kill Chapman. - But he did kill these men!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.24,1:23:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我的弟兄们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My men!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.53,1:23:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,中校 你不能杀金刚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't kill Kong, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.11,1:24:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,金刚是这座岛上的神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kong is god on this island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.66,1:24:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,只有它能阻档大蜥蜴爬出地表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the only thing keeping them lizard things in the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.37,1:24:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,中校 他说的对 我们不能杀金刚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right, Colonel. We can't kill Kong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.37,1:24:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,至于另一种怪物？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, that other creature?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.96,1:24:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那才是威胁 下面有更多只\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the threat. And there are more of them down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.62,1:24:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你破坏物种的自然竞争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you take away a species' natural competition,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.04,1:24:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,它们会繁殖到失控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they'll proliferate out of control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.46,1:24:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们也要终结它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we'll end them, too!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.84,1:24:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,在我们拿下金刚之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After we bring this thing down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.05,1:24:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,中校 我不能让你那样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't let you do that, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.63,1:24:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 停火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, whoa. Wait! Hold your fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.31,1:24:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们绝对不会输掉这场战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is one war we are not gonna lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.72,1:24:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nuts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.02,1:24:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到了 这简直疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear me? This is nuts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.19,1:24:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 你要听我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please! You need to listen to us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.98,1:24:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是交战 你会铸成大错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not at war, Colonel. You're making a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.48,1:24:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的谎言害我的属下被杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your lies got my men killed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.15,1:24:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你会害所有人被杀 - 这不是我们的战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you're gonna get us all killed! - Not our fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.19,1:24:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,上尉 你站哪一边？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whose side are you on, Captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.32,1:24:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 中校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.49,1:24:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你去那座山脊找你的海种马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll find your Sea Stallion three klicks up that ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.91,1:24:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我会带这些平民回到船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I'm gonna take these civilians back to the boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.00,1:24:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会在那里等你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we'll wait for you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.62,1:24:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.51,1:25:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,准备出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saddle up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.06,1:25:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,去杀掉金刚吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go kill this thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.70,1:25:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,史提夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steve,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.11,1:25:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你要跟我们去打怪 或跟他们去纳凉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you running with the big dogs or staying on the porch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.44,1:25:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想去纳凉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna be on the porch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.20,1:25:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,马洛 你没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marlow, you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.70,1:25:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.41,1:25:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你还想跟他争辩？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna talk with him about it again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.83,1:25:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他一开始就很坚决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He seemed to really go for it the first time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.70,1:25:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他失去理智了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's losing his grip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.71,1:25:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, follow me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.71,1:25:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会活着离开这座岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we'll get off this rock alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.22,1:25:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的比利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dear Billy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.97,1:25:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我正设法回家找你和你妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just trying to get home to you and your mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.39,1:25:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你要坚强喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You be strong, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.10,1:25:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,满满的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Much love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.44,1:26:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,确定他的家人会收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make sure those get back to his family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.99,1:26:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的比利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dear Billy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.66,1:26:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸是最优秀的军人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your dad was one of the best to ever do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.96,1:26:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,附近有水源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's water close by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.92,1:26:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你迷路了吗 走哪一边？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you lost? Which way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.09,1:26:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.27,1:26:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.31,1:26:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我要到高处找到河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to get to higher ground to find the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.65,1:26:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我也去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! I'm coming, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.98,1:26:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里守着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.82,1:26:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,保持警戎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your eyes open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.49,1:26:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,也要小心树上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up in the trees, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.66,1:26:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.83,1:26:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,蚂蚁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.96,1:26:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,很大只的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.13,1:27:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那里就有一只\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.88,1:27:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来像鸟 但居然是蚂蚁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like a bird, but it's a fucking ant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.64,1:27:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,尽量收集弹药 包括震源药包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gather up everything you can, including those seismic charges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.81,1:27:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次投弹就引起了它的注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got his attention the first time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.16,1:27:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个馊主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a bad idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.04,1:27:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,见机行事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just get on with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.83,1:27:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,米尔斯 科尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mills, Cole,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.04,1:27:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let's prep this ordinance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.04,1:27:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,特别招待它汽油弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make him a special gift out of that napalm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.53,1:28:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,船一定在河弯附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The boat must be around that bend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.15,1:30:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该走了 赶快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to go. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.56,1:30:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,别开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.44,1:30:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,康拉德 我们要走哪边？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Conrad, which way are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.27,1:30:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你们三人回去船上 往那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You three need to go back to the boat. It's that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.61,1:30:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,等我们到黎明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait for us till dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.23,1:30:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,如果到时我们还没回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we're not back by then,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.45,1:30:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,就先走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.70,1:30:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不必你逼我也会走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't gotta twist my arm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.11,1:30:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩要去哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you two going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.53,1:31:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去救金刚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to save Kong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.20,1:31:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,伙伴 少不了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not without me, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.18,1:32:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.58,1:33:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.83,1:33:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,预备冲锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Place your charges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.38,1:33:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,该是时候向金刚证明…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to show Kong{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.34,1:33:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,人类才是王者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that man is king!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.64,1:33:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,1号炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arm one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.85,1:33:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,2号炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arm two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.53,1:33:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,3号炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arm three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.72,1:33:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,派克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Packard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.19,1:33:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,千万不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.69,1:33:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我这次不会跟你们好好说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I asked you fellas nice the first time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.40,1:33:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们别在这里争吵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't wanna fight here, Packard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.95,1:33:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,它害我们坠机 杀了我的属下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing brought us down! It killed my men!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.20,1:33:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,金刚只是在扞卫自己的地盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kong was just defending his territory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.04,1:33:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是军人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are soldiers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.95,1:33:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们负责干肮脏勾当\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do the dirty work,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.41,1:33:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好让我们的家人和同胞不必害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so our families and our countrymen don't have to be afraid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.63,1:33:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他们甚至不该知道这玩意的存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They shouldn't even know a thing like this exists!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.25,1:33:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've lost your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.22,1:34:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,放下引爆器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put that detonator down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.52,1:34:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.74,1:34:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,别把世界想得这么狭隘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world is bigger than this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.49,1:34:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,女人 少插手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bitch, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.16,1:34:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,史利哥 把她带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slivko, get her out of there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.79,1:34:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子 你明知这样做是错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know it's the wrong thing to do, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.43,1:34:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,把它放下 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it down, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.38,1:34:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,派克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Packard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.12,1:35:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,认清吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.99,1:35:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.22,1:35:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the big one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.68,1:35:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.35,1:35:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.32,1:35:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,中校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.61,1:35:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.26,1:36:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧 你这王八…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Die, you mother...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.61,1:36:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,金刚倒下了 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kong's down. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.79,1:36:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要我们黎明时离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They told us to leave at dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.29,1:36:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 已经黎明了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know. - It's dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.46,1:36:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.71,1:36:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what are we going to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.55,1:36:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这是岛的边缘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the edge of the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.89,1:37:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,韦弗 爬上岩壁发射信号弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weaver, get up on those rocks and fire a flare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.31,1:37:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,运气好的话 布鲁克斯会看见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With any luck, Brooks will see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.90,1:37:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会帮你争取时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll buy you time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.65,1:37:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.33,1:37:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 分秒不能浪费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Every second counts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.80,1:37:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,科尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.30,1:37:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,过来 我们要撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man, we gotta fall back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.89,1:37:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,享受你们的人生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go live your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.60,1:37:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.77,1:37:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 科尔 不要 - 科尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cole, no! - Cole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.94,1:37:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 科尔 不要 - 别去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cole, no! - Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.19,1:37:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 科尔 - 科尔 科尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cole! - Cole! Cole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.11,1:37:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 别去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.61,1:37:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,科尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ALL: Cole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.82,1:37:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,科尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.12,1:38:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,放马过来 你这王八蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on, you son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.15,1:38:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.09,1:40:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.35,1:40:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 赶快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.10,1:40:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come On!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.11,1:40:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,马洛 帮个忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marlow, a little help here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.28,1:40:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我来 这玩意会闹脾气 当心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it. She's temperamental. Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.71,1:41:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 搞定 - 搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clear! - Clear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.80,1:41:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 你这混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you bastard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.43,1:42:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,韦弗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weaver!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.67,1:44:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,韦弗 韦弗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weaver? Weaver.{\r}
