Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.17,1:44:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.56,1:45:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,伙伴们 你们觉得呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what do you think, fellas?{\r}
