Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.23,1:45:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it is, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.15,1:45:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这个地方会改观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place will change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.74,1:45:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,消息会传开来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Word will get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.95,1:45:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,迟早的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It always does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.91,1:45:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,至少不会从我们口中说出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's not coming from us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.66,1:45:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会重逢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll meet again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.50,1:45:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不知在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't know where{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.92,1:45:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不知在何时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't know when{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.09,1:45:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但我知道我们会重逢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I know we'll meet again{\r}
