Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.37,1:48:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,进入第8局小熊队进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}here we go now to the Cub half of number eight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.33,1:48:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想看疯在群众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want to see a crowd go crazy,{\r}
