Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.92,1:48:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,球飞得很远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fly ball, very deep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.51,1:48:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能的梦想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the impossible dream{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.63,1:48:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才美梦成真了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just became the possible dream!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.99,1:56:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你们打算坐在那里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just gonna sit there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.08,1:56:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,在黑暗中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.50,1:56:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你们乐在其中 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're enjoying this, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.63,1:56:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你们把这当成乐趣？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this fun for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.75,1:56:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证不会告诉俄国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise I won't tell the Russians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.09,1:57:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我保证会告诉俄国人 - 她会告诉俄国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I promise I will tell the Russians. - She's gonna tell the Russians.{\r}
