Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.10,1:57:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我想要回家 - 我们懂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I wanna go home. - We get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.10,1:57:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,根本没有岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was no island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.61,1:57:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们从没去过岛上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were never on an island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.15,1:57:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,岛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Island?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.32,1:57:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,什么岛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What island?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.61,1:57:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁克斯 搞什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brooks, what the hell is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.61,1:57:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到帝王计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Monarch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.78,1:57:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这座岛只是开端\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This island is just the beginning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.37,1:57:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那里有更多秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's more out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.95,1:57:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,"更多"是什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, "more"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.66,1:57:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这也界从不属于我们 是属于它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This world never belonged to us. It belonged to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.79,1:57:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是 还要多久它们会今回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The question is how long before they take it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.50,1:57:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,金刚不是唯一的霸主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kong is not the only king.{\r}
